<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pier 1 Imports raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pier 1 Imports raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said it upgraded Pier 1 Imports Inc to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/8 to 16-3/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
